const norm=(s)=>String(s??'').normalize('NFKD').toLocaleLowerCase('en').replace(/[\u0300-\u036f]/g,'');
const englishText={"データセットから探す": "Browse datasets", "データセットを探す": "Browse datasets", "既存13データセットと追加3資料群を横断して、リズム・和声・旋律の事例と出典を探す。": "Explore musical examples and sources across 16 datasets and source collections.", "横断検索へ移動": "Skip to catalogue search", "Notable Musical Patterns トップ": "Notable Musical Patterns home", "主要ナビゲーション": "Main navigation", "トップ": "Home", "概念で探す": "Explore concepts", "データセット": "Datasets", "パターン図鑑": "Pattern guide", "世界の音楽を、楽譜・演奏・研究注釈からたどる横断カタログ。サイト内の試聴、配布元の再生ページ、別演奏の候補を区別しました。": "Explore music through scores, performances and research annotations. This catalogue distinguishes playable excerpts on this site, listening pages at the source, and possible alternative performances.", "資料を横断検索する": "Search the catalogue", "16資料群を一覧する": "Browse all 16 sources", "データセット・資料群": "Datasets and source collections", "カタログ内の試聴": "Playable catalogue excerpts", "サイト内音声なし": "Entries without on-site audio", "全6,729検索項目のうち、2,983件にサイト内試聴があります。サイト内音声のない3,746件のうち578件には、提供元の試聴ページや別演奏へのリンクがあります。項目数は固有の曲数ではありません。": "Of the 6,729 catalogue entries, 2,983 have audio on this site. Of the 3,746 entries without on-site audio, 578 link to listening pages at the source or to alternative performances. Entries are not a count of unique compositions.", "掲載範囲と利用条件 ↗": "Coverage and usage terms ↗", "検索と試聴": "Search and listen", "名前・様式・楽器・IDなど": "Title, style, instrument or ID", "例：サンバ、ブルース、Syrtos、funk": "Try samba, blues, Syrtos or funk", "すべて": "All", "表示方法": "Show", "サイト内音源": "On-site audio", "外部の試聴・録音候補": "External listening links", "参照のみ": "Reference only", "出典をたどる": "Source references", "メタデータ・分析": "Metadata and analysis", "クリア": "Clear", "プレーヤーを操作": "Go to player", "一致する項目がありません。検索語を短くするか、絞り込みを外してください。": "No entries match. Try a shorter search or remove a filter.", "検索結果のページ": "Search results pages", "← 前へ": "← Previous", "次へ →": "Next →", "データセット・資料群を選ぶ": "Choose a dataset or source collection", "利用条件と検証範囲": "Usage terms and verification", "は、出典、利用条件、帰属、変更内容を確認した短い試聴です。Freesoundの拍子は投稿者の表記に基づき、独立検証済みではありません。実演録音、電子ドラム出力、MIDI合成音を区別します。": " consists of short excerpts with documented sources, terms, attribution and changes. Time signatures for Freesound recordings follow the uploader’s description and have not been independently verified. Performance recordings, electronic drum output and MIDI synthesis are distinguished.", "外部リンク": "External links", "は提供元のページを開きます。このページにはYouTubeやSpotifyのプレーヤーを読み込みません。行き先での再生可否・版・箇所の一致は保証しません。": " open the provider’s page. This page does not load YouTube or Spotify players. Playback availability and a match to the exact recording or passage are not guaranteed.", "には出典・外部ページの案内を含みます。未確認音声や元の楽譜・MIDI・DBは同梱しません。": " entries include source references and external pages. Unverified audio and the original scores, MIDI files and databases are not bundled here.", "データセット別の内訳・利用条件": "Coverage and terms by dataset", "横断カタログを使うにはJavaScriptを有効にしてください。": "Enable JavaScript to use the searchable catalogue.", "試聴プレーヤー": "Audio player", "閉じる ×": "Close ×", "ページ上部へ ↑": "Back to top ↑", "メインコンテンツへ移動": "Skip to main content", "NOTABLE MUSICAL PATTERNS / 公開範囲": "NOTABLE MUSICAL PATTERNS / COVERAGE", "掲載範囲と利用条件": "Coverage and usage terms", "一次資料 ↗": "Primary source ↗", "検索する ↗": "Browse entries ↗", "南アジアの歌唱：ROD": "South Asian vocal exercises: ROD", "日本の歴史楽譜": "Historical Japanese scores", "4/4以外の実演候補：Freesound": "Performances described as non-4/4: Freesound", "O’Neill’s Music of Ireland（1903）": "O’Neill’s Music of Ireland (1903)", "16データセット・資料群から6,729検索項目を掲載しています。横断カタログのサイト内試聴は2,983件、サイト内音声のない項目は3,746件です。この3,746件のうち578件には、提供元の試聴ページや別演奏の参照リンクがあります。外部サービスのプレーヤーは埋め込んでいません。": "This catalogue contains 6,729 entries from 16 datasets and source collections: 2,983 have on-site audio and 3,746 do not. Of the latter, 578 link to listening pages at the source or to alternative performances. Players from external services are not embedded.", "このカタログの試聴にはMutopia合成音1,168件を含みます。資料群ごとの件数は本サイトの掲載範囲を示し、提供元データ全体の規模とは区別します。外部サービスは、そのリンクを選んだ場合にのみ提供元サイトが開きます。地域・アカウントによる再生制限、録音版や箇所の一致は保証しません。": "The playable catalogue includes 1,168 synthesized Mutopia excerpts. Counts by source describe this site’s coverage, not necessarily the size of the original dataset. An external provider is opened only when you follow its link. Availability may depend on region or account; an exact match to the recording or passage is not guaranteed.", "は対象素材に限ります。作品・録音・編曲の権利は一括して許諾されません。各音源の帰属と変更内容は検索結果のカードを参照してください。": " apply only to the materials they cover. They do not provide blanket permission for compositions, recordings or arrangements. See each result card for audio attribution and changes.", "掲載音源は参照版のPublic Domain表示と版別の帰属に基づきます。他の版・録音・歌詞を一括して許諾するものではありません。": "The audio is based on the public-domain designation and attribution of the referenced edition. This does not grant blanket permission for other editions, recordings or lyrics.", "CC BY 4.0・帰属と変更表示。配布元の合奏録音8小節抜粋。全編なし。": "CC BY 4.0, with attribution and a description of changes. Eight-bar excerpts from the distributed ensemble recordings; no complete recordings.", "CC BY 4.0・帰属と変更表示。公式電子ドラム出力の照合済み抜粋のみ。照合保留16件・独自合成60件は出典のみ。": "CC BY 4.0, with attribution and changes. Only matched excerpts of the official electronic drum output are playable. The 16 entries still awaiting a match and 60 independently synthesized versions remain source references only.", "書誌・原典参照。電子採譜からの合成音は未掲載です。原譜との照合と、GPLに対応するソース・通知・変更記録の整備が必要です。": "Bibliographic and original-source references only. Synthesis from the digital transcriptions is not published here. It requires comparison with the original score and preparation of the source, notices and change records required by the GPL.", "注釈はCC0、録音の権利は別です。原録音は配布されないため自前音声なし。代表の動画はYouTube外部リンクのみ。": "The annotations are CC0; rights in recordings are separate. The original recordings are not distributed, so no audio is hosted here. Selected videos are external YouTube links only.", "Burgoyne, Wild &amp; Fujinaga, McGill Billboard Project. 限定的にCoCoPopsの参照動画IDを参照。録音素材はなし。": "Burgoyne, Wild &amp; Fujinaga, McGill Billboard Project. A limited set of reference video IDs is drawn from CoCoPops. No recordings are included.", "公式リンク・概要のみ。個別ソロデータと録音は未掲載です。派生データのODbL/DbCLへの対応と提供条件の確認を残しています。": "An overview and official links only. Individual solo data and recordings are not published here. Compliance with ODbL/DbCL for derived data and the provider’s terms remains to be resolved.", "Jazzomat Research Project / Hochschule für Musik Franz Liszt Weimar。ODbL 1.0 / DbCL 1.0。個別データの再配布なし。": "Jazzomat Research Project / Hochschule für Musik Franz Liszt Weimar. ODbL 1.0 / DbCL 1.0. Individual data records are not redistributed.", "公式リンク・概要のみ。個別メタデータと合成音は未掲載です。CC BY-NCの条件に公開目的が適合するか確認を残しています。": "An overview and official links only. Individual metadata and synthesized audio are not published here. Whether this publication purpose meets the CC BY-NC conditions remains to be confirmed.", "Rie Matsunaga、Taichi Ishimoto、Pitoyo Hartono、Jun-ichi Abe。JSMel v2、CC BY-NC 4.0。個別データの再配布なし。": "Rie Matsunaga, Taichi Ishimoto, Pitoyo Hartono and Jun-ichi Abe. JSMel v2, CC BY-NC 4.0. Individual data records are not redistributed.", "CC BY 4.0・帰属と変更表示。短尺品質確認済みのみ。原録音全編と品質保留57件は音源対象外。": "CC BY 4.0, with attribution and changes. Only short excerpts that passed the quality checks are playable. Complete recordings and 57 entries with unresolved quality issues are excluded from audio publication.", "CC BY 4.0・帰属と変更表示。357抜粋のみ。原録音全編と注釈保留3件は音源対象外。": "CC BY 4.0, with attribution and changes. Only 357 excerpts are playable. Complete recordings and three entries with unresolved annotations are excluded from audio publication.", "CC BY 4.0の採譜目録・公式リンク。参考録音への外部リンクのみ。配布MIDIからの合成70件と譜面不一致4件の対応動画は保留。": "A transcription catalogue and official links under CC BY 4.0. Recordings are linked externally only. The 70 MIDI-derived syntheses and video matches for four score discrepancies remain on hold.", "Anna-Maria Christodoulou、Olivier Lartillot。Greek Folk Music Dataset v2、CC BY 4.0。目録・参考リンクを整理し、MIDI・録音は転載なし。": "Anna-Maria Christodoulou and Olivier Lartillot. Greek Folk Music Dataset v2, CC BY 4.0. Catalogue information and reference links are organized here; MIDI and recordings are not republished.", "採譜ではなく打撃分類・目録のみ。音声は未掲載です。学習音源の上流の利用条件を確認できていないため、デポジットの表示だけで再配布可能とは判断していません。": "Stroke classifications and a catalogue, not musical transcriptions. No audio is published. The upstream terms for training recordings remain unconfirmed, so the repository’s license label alone is not treated as permission to redistribute them.", "M. A. Rohit、Amitrajit Bhattacharjee、Preeti Rao。4-way Tabla Stroke v1、デポジットCC BY 4.0。録音IDと区分のみ整理。": "M. A. Rohit, Amitrajit Bhattacharjee and Preeti Rao. 4-way Tabla Stroke v1; the repository states CC BY 4.0. Only recording IDs and categories are organized here.", "注釈CC BY 4.0／録音は別。原曲の録音は含まれないため、出典が示すSpotifyリンクのみ。埋め込み・全曲再生の保証なし。": "Annotations: CC BY 4.0; recording rights are separate. No original recordings are included. Only Spotify links supplied by the source are provided, with no embedding or guarantee of full-track playback.", "Carlos de Lemos Almada、Hugo Carvalho、Felipe Defensor Martins。MPB Corpus v1.1、CC BY 4.0。作曲者・作品名・録音候補IDを抽出し表示。": "Carlos de Lemos Almada, Hugo Carvalho and Felipe Defensor Martins. MPB Corpus v1.1, CC BY 4.0. Composer names, work titles and candidate recording IDs are extracted and displayed.", "CORA CC BY 4.0／Freesound音源 CC BY 3.0。原音の出典とライセンスは確認済み。元作品・歌詞・編曲の確認を残すため自前音源は保留し、28録音の提供元リンクを維持。": "CORA: CC BY 4.0; Freesound recordings: CC BY 3.0. Recording sources and license statements have been checked. Rights in underlying works, lyrics and arrangements remain unresolved, so the 28 recordings are linked at the source rather than hosted here.", "4ラーガの歌唱練習24件。音声の内容と曲・歌詞の権利の照合後に試聴を検討。": "Twenty-four vocal exercises in four rāgas. Audio will be considered after checks of the recording content and rights in music and lyrics.", "保護期間満了表示のある原譜を基に新規合成。雅楽の合竹例は構成音の提示であり、原譜の拍節・手移り・息づかいの再現ではありません。楽譜画像・既存録音の転載はありません。": "New synthesis based on original scores marked as out of copyright. The gagaku aitake examples present constituent pitches; they do not recreate meter, fingering transitions or breath. Score images and existing recordings are not republished.", "公式の試聴音声を、一部短尺化してAACで掲載。各項目に投稿者・ライセンス・変更内容を記載しました。拍子は投稿者表記で、独立未検証です。": "Official preview audio, with some excerpts shortened and encoded as AAC. Each entry credits the uploader and records the license and changes. Time signatures follow uploader descriptions and are not independently verified.", "#894の新規版は初回候補から外し、既存公開範囲を維持。": "The new edition of #894 is excluded; the existing published scope is retained.", "配布元の合奏録音8小節抜粋。全編なし。": "Eight-bar excerpts from the distributed ensemble recordings; no complete recordings.", "公式電子ドラム出力の照合済み抜粋のみ。照合保留16件・独自合成60件は出典のみ。": "Only matched excerpts of the official electronic drum output. Sixteen entries awaiting a match and 60 independently synthesized versions remain source references only.", "合成1,506件は原譜照合と対応するGPL用ソース・通知・変更台帳の準備待ち。": "The 1,506 synthesized versions await comparison with the original score and preparation of GPL source, notices and change records.", "注釈はCC0。原録音は配布されないため自前音声なし。代表の動画はYouTube外部リンクのみ。": "Annotations are CC0. No audio is hosted because original recordings are not distributed. Selected videos are external YouTube links only.", "個別456ソロは派生DBのODbL/DbCLと提供条件の整備待ち。録音の再配布なし。": "The 456 individual solos await arrangements for ODbL/DbCL-compliant derived data and the provider’s terms. Recordings are not redistributed.", "個別960行と合成546件は公開目的がCC BY-NCに適合するか確認するまでは非公開。": "The 960 individual rows and 546 synthesized versions remain private until the publication purpose is confirmed to meet CC BY-NC.", "短尺品質確認済みのみ。原録音全編と品質保留57件は音源対象外。": "Only short excerpts that passed quality checks. Complete recordings and 57 entries with unresolved quality issues are excluded.", "357抜粋のみ。原録音全編と注釈保留3件は音源対象外。": "Only 357 excerpts. Complete recordings and three entries with unresolved annotations are excluded.", "参考録音への外部リンクのみ。配布MIDIからの合成70件と譜面不一致4件の対応動画は保留。": "External reference recordings only. The 70 MIDI syntheses and video matches for four score discrepancies remain on hold.", "学習音源の上流条件未確認。評価用10件を次の個別候補として切り分け、全編は本候補に入れない。": "Upstream terms for training audio remain unconfirmed. Ten evaluation recordings are separated for possible individual review; complete recordings are excluded.", "原曲の録音は含まれないため、出典が示すSpotifyリンクのみ。埋め込み・全曲再生の保証なし。": "No original recordings are included. Only source-supplied Spotify links are shown; no embedding or guarantee of full-track playback.", "原音の出典とライセンスは確認済み。元作品・歌詞・編曲の確認を残すため自前音源は保留し、28録音の提供元リンクを維持。": "Recording sources and license statements are checked. Underlying works, lyrics and arrangements remain unresolved, so 28 source links are retained instead of hosted audio.", "歴史楽譜34曲のうち24曲を原譜から合成。雅楽の合竹例は演奏・拍節の再現ではありません。": "Twenty-four of 34 historical-score entries have been synthesized from the original. Gagaku aitake examples do not recreate performance or meter.", "公式試聴15件。拍子は投稿者の表記で、独立検証済みではありません。拍子や録音方法の不明点は項目別に表示します。": "Fifteen official previews. Meter follows the uploader’s description and has not been independently verified. Uncertainties are noted per entry.", "各版のPublic Domain表示。組版・版の帰属は項目別。": "Public-domain designation for each referenced edition; typesetting and edition credits are recorded per entry.", "CC BY 4.0": "CC BY 4.0", "原典と電子採譜を区別：ABC採譜はGPL-2.0-or-later": "Original edition and digital transcription are separate: ABC transcriptions use GPL-2.0-or-later.", "注釈CC0 1.0。楽曲・録音の権利は別": "Annotations: CC0 1.0. Rights in music and recordings are separate.", "ODbL 1.0 / DbCL 1.0。楽曲・録音の権利は別": "ODbL 1.0 / DbCL 1.0. Rights in music and recordings are separate.", "CC BY-NC 4.0（メタデータを含む）": "CC BY-NC 4.0, including metadata.", "CC BY 4.0（公式デポジット）": "CC BY 4.0 (official repository).", "デポジット CC BY 4.0。元作品・録音の権利は別途確認が必要": "Repository: CC BY 4.0. Rights in underlying works and recordings require separate checks.", "デポジット CC BY 4.0。収録録音の個別由来・権利を追加確認": "Repository: CC BY 4.0. Provenance and rights of individual recordings require further checks.", "注釈 CC BY 4.0。原曲の録音・楽譜の権利は含まない": "Annotations: CC BY 4.0. This does not cover the original recordings or scores.", "CORA CC BY 4.0。Freesound版 CC BY 3.0。上流記譜資料は別途確認": "CORA: CC BY 4.0. Freesound: CC BY 3.0. Upstream notation requires separate review.", "公開版 v4 の表示は CC BY 4.0。ここでは出典と録音IDのみ。": "Public version 4 states CC BY 4.0. Only source references and recording IDs are shown here.", "資料単位でPDM表示または個別確認中。楽譜画像は転載しない。": "Public Domain Mark or individual review at item level. Score images are not republished.", "各録音のCC BYまたはCC0表示を参照。": "See each recording’s CC BY or CC0 designation.", "電子採譜からの合成音は未掲載です。原譜との照合と、GPLに対応するソース・通知・変更記録の整備が必要です。": "Synthesis from digital transcriptions is not published. Comparison with the original score and GPL-compliant source, notices and change records remain necessary.", "個別ソロデータと録音は未掲載です。派生データのODbL/DbCLへの対応と提供条件の確認を残しています。": "Individual solo data and recordings are not published. Compliance with ODbL/DbCL for derived data and the provider’s terms remains to be resolved.", "個別メタデータと合成音は未掲載です。CC BY-NCの条件に公開目的が適合するか確認を残しています。": "Individual metadata and synthesized audio are not published. Whether this publication purpose meets CC BY-NC remains to be confirmed.", "音声は未掲載です。学習音源の上流の利用条件を確認できていないため、デポジットの表示だけで再配布可能とは判断していません。": "No audio is published. Upstream terms for training recordings remain unconfirmed, so the repository license label alone is not treated as redistribution permission.", "MIDI合成音": "MIDI synthesis", "人の演奏・電子ドラムの合成音": "Human performance on electronic drums", "実演録音": "Performance recording", "試聴未掲載": "Audio not published", "原譜に基づく新規合成（実演なし）": "New synthesis from the original score, not a performance", "原譜を転記した合成音": "Synthesis from a transcription of the original score", "合竹の構成音の例（演奏再現ではない）": "Aitake pitch example, not a performance reconstruction", "投稿者による参考試聴（拍子未検証）": "Uploader’s preview; meter unverified", "Public Domain（Mutopiaでの当該版の表示）": "Public domain (Mutopia’s designation for this edition)", "CC BY 4.0（公開版）": "CC BY 4.0 (public version)", "個別の音源・楽譜の再利用条件は未確認。": "Reuse terms for individual recordings and scores are unconfirmed.", "原譜：保護期間満了表示。音源：このサイトの新規合成。": "Original score: marked as out of copyright. Audio: newly synthesized for this site.", "原譜：国立国会図書館の保護期間満了表示。試聴：新規合成。既存録音の転載なし。": "Original score: National Diet Library’s out-of-copyright designation. Audio: new synthesis; no existing recording is republished.", "Freesoundで演奏を開く ↗": "Open performance on Freesound ↗", "Spotifyで録音候補 ↗": "Candidate recording on Spotify ↗", "YouTubeで参考演奏 ↗": "Reference performance on YouTube ↗", "元録音の候補を開く ↗": "Open candidate source recording ↗", "歴史録音の資料ページ ↗": "Historical recording reference ↗", "出典 ↗": "Source ↗", "合竹の構成音の資料 ↗": "Aitake pitch reference ↗", "Freesoundの個別ページ。同じ録音ID。CORA配布MP3と同一バイトとは限りません。": "Individual Freesound page for the same recording ID. Its file need not be byte-identical to the CORA MP3.", "公式アーカイブの参照録音。1903年版とは異なる構成です。": "A reference recording from the official archive. Its arrangement differs from the 1903 edition.", "出典が自動照合した録音候補。録音版・該当時刻は独立照合していません。": "A candidate recording automatically matched by the source. Recording version and timing have not been independently matched.", "出典の参考録音。録音版・該当時刻は独立照合していません。": "A reference recording supplied by the source. Recording version and timing have not been independently matched.", "同一動画に対応する参考録音。注釈元の録音版は未照合です。": "Reference recording linked to the same video. Its match to the annotated recording version is unverified.", "エア・歌曲": "Airs and songs", "ポピュラー音楽": "Popular music", "公開条件を確認中": "Publication terms under review", "カンドンベ合奏：4拍の周期": "Candombe ensemble: four-beat cycle", "カノン進行": "Canon progression", "Autumn Leaves型": "Autumn Leaves-type progression", "ビート：": "Beat: ", "フィル：": "Fill: ", "カンドンベ": "Candombe", "切出し・端部5msフェード、音量変更なし。": "Excerpted with 5 ms end fades; no gain change.", "さらに試聴WAVをAACに変換（必要に応じて再標本化）。": "The preview WAV was then converted to AAC, resampling where needed.", "録音単位": "Recording-level entry", "採譜単位": "Transcription-level entry", "Tabla / 打撃分類": "Tabla / stroke classification", "譜面注釈に当該進行を含む伴奏演奏の冒頭8秒。進行全体の再生ではありません。実音の和音は独立未検証。": "The first eight seconds of an accompaniment performance whose score annotation includes this progression. This is not the complete progression, and the recorded chords have not been independently verified.", "提供データの様式ラベル。公式拍位置注釈に基づく2/4拍子・4小節の合奏抜粋。特定楽器の定型リズム認定ではありません。": "Style label supplied with the data. A four-bar ensemble excerpt in 2/4 based on the official beat annotations. This does not identify a named rhythm in any individual instrument.", "学習セット。4分類の打撃注釈あり。時刻反復の機械候補あり。音楽理論上のパターン認定ではない。": "Training set with four-class stroke annotations. Repeated timing produces machine-generated candidates, not identified music-theoretical patterns.", "ダブルジグ": "Double jig", "リール": "Reel", "ホーンパイプ": "Hornpipe", "カロラン作品": "Carolan compositions", "スリップジグ": "Slip jig", "行進曲ほか": "Marches and other tunes", "ロングダンス": "Long dance", "順次進行を中心とする旋律": "Predominantly stepwise melody", "同音反復": "Repeated notes", "旋律中の三和音の構成音": "Triad tones within a melody", "付点リズムの3対1": "Dotted rhythm in a 3:1 ratio", "4音の上行順次進行": "Four-note ascending stepwise motion", "4音の下行順次進行": "Four-note descending stepwise motion", "付点音価を含む音型": "Figure with dotted note values", "付点リズム": "Dotted rhythm", "同じ音高の連続反復": "Consecutive repetitions of one pitch", "オクターヴ跳躍": "Octave leap", "等音価の連続音型": "Successive notes of equal duration", "拍をまたぐタイ": "Tie across a beat", "分散和音": "Broken chord", "下の隣接音から戻る": "Return from the lower neighboring note", "隣接音の往復": "Motion to and from a neighboring note", "学習セット。4分類の打撃注釈あり。名称付きパターンは未認定。": "Training set. Strokes are annotated in four classes; no named musical pattern has been established.", "評価セット。4分類の打撃注釈あり。時刻反復の機械候補あり。音楽理論上のパターン認定ではない。": "Evaluation set. Strokes are annotated in four classes. Timing repetitions are machine-detected candidates, not established music-theoretical patterns.", "公式録音と注釈を確認。歌詞・第三者の曲の引用について確認が残るため、音源は未掲載。": "The official recording and annotations were checked. Audio is not hosted because checks of lyrics and quotations from third-party works remain unresolved.", "公式録音と注釈を確認。歌詞・第三者の曲の引用について確認が残るため、音源は未掲載。 配布資料との対応の追加確認が必要。": "The official recording and annotations were checked. Audio is not hosted because checks of lyrics and quotations from third-party works remain unresolved. Further matching against the distributed materials is needed.", "原譜から音高・音価を転記した器楽の試聴です。歌詞・現代の伴奏・既存録音は使っていません。": "An instrumental synthesis transcribed from pitches and durations in the original score. It does not use lyrics, modern accompaniment or an existing recording.", "邦楽・古典楽譜": "Historical Japanese music scores", "唱歌 4/4": "School song in 4/4", "3/4・手演奏ピアノのフレーズ": "3/4 piano phrase played by a person", "拍子は投稿者の表記です。独立した音楽的検証は未実施です。 投稿者による手演奏。アコースティックか電子音源かは未確認です。": "Meter follows the uploader’s description and has not been independently verified. The uploader describes a human performance; whether the sound is acoustic or electronic is unconfirmed."};
